    "Boris Johnson wins a second term in the closest mayoral race yet",
    "Johnson beats Livingstone 51.5% to 48.5% after second preferences",
    "Labour becomes the largest Assembly party for the first time (12 seats)",
    "Turnout falls to 37.4%, the lowest at a London election so far",
    "The BNP loses the single Assembly seat it won in 2008"
